Building on the leg and flight enhancements of the Mark X, Tony redesigned the helmet faceplate to be noticeably sharper and more angular, while adding specialized silver-accented thermal vents across the chest plate and shoulders. These vents dissipated internal reactor heat more evenly, making the suit harder to detect on infrared sensors. The suit answered the call during the House Party Protocol, joining the swarm of Iron Legion armors fighting the Extremis soldiers before being destroyed in the "Clean Slate" protocol.
